# InkLex — Practice & Capture agent

Канон: `docs/algorithms/due-first-session.md`, `docs/product/PRODUCT-PLAN.md`, `docs/product/CAPTURE-MVP.md`.

## Architecture (do not regress)

- Formats live in `src/lib/practiceFormats.ts` registry (`PracticeFormatMeta`).
- Shared shell: `usePracticeSession` + `PracticeSession` — **no** new copy-paste session components.
- New practice mode = registry entry + prompt branch in `PracticeSession` (or Prompt adapter), same deck/grade wiring.
- Modes: `quest` | `quest-reverse` | `quest-typed` | `review` (`inklex.learningMode`).

## Session rules

- Quest pool: `new`/`learning`, max 10, due-first then rest. Known excluded.
- **Reverse Quest**: `minPoolSize = 3` (`MIN_REVERSE_QUEST_WORDS`). Hub disables Start below that.
- Progress `N/N` advances on leave (answer / requeue / Skip|Next). At **N/N**, next grade or Skip/Next **ends** session (leftover → Skipped).
- **Again** writes immediately on fail (resets streak); may requeue once unless already at N/N budget.
- **Good/Easy**: streak += 1; at **3** → Known. Grade via functional `setCards` + latest card state (no stale streak).
- Review: flip + Bad / Good / Easy; **End Review** in header; hide End controls on final screen.
- **Typed Quest wrong**: show answer + **Continue** (manual). Do **not** auto-advance on miss. Correct may short-auto-advance.

## Capture (ставка A)

- T1/T2 shipped: `QuickAdd` + `parseClipboardLexeme` (`word — meaning` / tab / plain).
- Quick add only in a **folder** (not All). Full `CardEditor` remains for rich edit.
- Next: T3 sentence→word, T4 post-save Quest nudge — see `CAPTURE-MVP.md`.

## Do not

- Reintroduce separate LearningSession/ReviewSession logic trees.
- Defer `again` until retry success (breaks Known streak honesty).
- Let N/N hang with leftover queue (must force summary).
- Auto-skip past Typed miss feedback.
- Put Known into Quest pool or build full SM-2 without an explicit product ask.
